---
// Tour Reports + Guide Dashboard — two-panel section
---
<section id="reports" class="reports-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reports-layout">
      <div class="reports-text">
        <span class="section-label">Planned guide output</span>
        <h2>Turn a day outside into something worth keeping.</h2>
        <p class="reports-subtitle">
          The planned Followbirds report will bring together species, route, photos, notes, and guest memories in one shareable follow-up.
        </p>

        <ul class="reports-features">
          <li><span class="check-icon">✓</span>Tour details and route</li>
          <li><span class="check-icon">✓</span>Species and sightings</li>
          <li><span class="check-icon">✓</span>Photos and guide notes</li>
          <li><span class="check-icon">✓</span>Shareable guest summary</li>
        </ul>

      </div>

      <div class="reports-visual">
        <div class="report-card">
          <div class="report-card-header">
            <div class="report-tour-info">
              <div class="report-tour-name">Example report preview</div>
              <div class="report-meta">Ria Formosa · A planned Followbirds guide output</div>
            </div>
            <div class="report-stats-row">
              <div class="report-stat">
                <span class="stat-num">98</span>
                <span class="stat-lbl">Species Observed</span>
              </div>
              <div class="report-stat">
                <span class="stat-num">12</span>
                <span class="stat-lbl">Participants</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="report-card-body">
            <div class="report-includes-label">Includes:</div>
            <div class="report-items">
              <div class="report-item">Tour details</div>
              <div class="report-item">Guide & date</div>
              <div class="report-item">Route map</div>
              <div class="report-item">Species observed</div>
              <div class="report-item">Photos</div>
              <div class="report-item">Guide notes</div>
              <div class="report-item">Weather conditions</div>
              <div class="report-item">Participants</div>
            </div>

            <div class="report-output">
              <span class="output-badge pdf">📄 PDF Export</span>
              <span class="output-badge link">🔗 Shareable Link</span>
              <span class="output-badge history">📖 Followbirds History</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .reports-section {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    padding: 6rem 0;
  }

  .reports-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .reports-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .reports-features {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .reports-features li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .reports-features .check-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--green-soft);
    color: var(--green-deep);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Report Card ── */
  .report-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .report-card-header {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .report-tour-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .report-meta {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .report-stats-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .report-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-lbl {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .report-card-body {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .report-includes-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #727272;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .report-items {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.3rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .report-item {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .report-output {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .output-badge {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    background: var(--green-soft);
    color: var(--green-deep);
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .reports-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .reports-subtitle {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .reports-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .report-items {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
